 and the conditions by which it may be permitted being clearly and specifically stated within these zoning regulations, and the allowance being by express permission of the Board of Zoning Appeals.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"79b8a0fe-7d50-5ae5-be14-9524bd0d152d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.050","content_hash":"4cebb6c7c526f3a93a390445e931a7941f9c9a1237738ccac3dbc34f088d35f3","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.050:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.050","text":"Extension or To Extend. See “Enlargement” or “to enlarge.”","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"09d23e64-1f9a-53e3-985b-60c956fd1bdc"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.050","content_hash":"c1a8584671c76e07ee96845054c0bd5d3e34f9a5ee7a9153d76ca13152be115c","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.050:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.050","text":"“Exterior wall surface” means the outside face of a wall, screen or material covering a building. (Ord. 19370 § 103, 3-23-10. Code 1995 Appx. C, Art. XXXV.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"41691a7d-f740-52a3-b841-a52e38f43432"},{"attributes":{"legacy_definition_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.55.050:def:easement"},"citation":"18.55.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.050","content_hash":"ddc9d1965b1a1455a152baae2e963389193c5462c5681d48cbf609ac4b49f225","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:munic